description: UI kit rules — components, tokens, variants and accessibility
globs: components/ui/**,lib/ui/**,styles/**,lib/tokens/**
alwaysApply: false
---

You are editing the UI kit. Read `rules/07-ui-system.md` first.

- Components stay data-agnostic, controlled, ref-forwarding and accessible (labels, keyboard, focus, `aria-*` only where needed).
- Style with semantic tokens only; variants through CVA.
- Theme values live in `lib/tokens` — run `pnpm tokens:generate`, never edit `styles/tokens/*.css` by hand.
- Every change ships with a test in the folder's `__tests__/`.
